:: Utility_Closet {"position":"400,650","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
/* ===================================================================== */
/* 0. INITIALIZATION & SETUP                                             */
/* ===================================================================== */
<<set $currentLocation to "Utility">>

/* --- Set Base and Halved Stamina Costs --- */
<<set _baseCost to 10>>
<<set _halfCost to Math.round(_baseCost / 2)>>

/* --- Initialize Room Variables --- */
<<if not $utility_opened>><<set $utility_opened to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_flashlight>><<set $looted_utility_flashlight to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_bleach>><<set $looted_utility_bleach to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_gloves>><<set $looted_utility_gloves to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_tape>><<set $looted_utility_tape to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_rope>><<set $looted_utility_rope to false>><</if>>
<<if not $looted_utility_batteries>><<set $looted_utility_batteries to false>><</if>>
<<if not $read_utility_log>><<set $read_utility_log to false>><</if>>
<</nobr>>


<<if not $utility_opened>>
/* ===================================================================== */
/* PHASE 1: THE JAMMED HANDLE (LOCKED STATE)                             */
/* ===================================================================== */
<h2>UTILITY CLOSET — THE JAMMED HANDLE</h2>

<div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
    <img src="image/hallway/utility_door_locked.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
</div>

The door at the end of the hall is unmarked except for a faded hazard stripe along its base and a small metal plate: *MAINTENANCE — AUTHORIZED ACCESS ONLY*. Someone has scratched out *AUTHORIZED ACCESS* with a key.

The handle doesn't turn. Not locked — you can tell by the feel of the mechanism, the way it moves but catches — just jammed. Rusted through, or something shifted in the door frame.

You press your ear to the door. Inside, something rattles. Light and metallic. The building settling, or loose gear shifting on a shelf every time the walls vibrate.

<div style="margin-top:20px; padding:15px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-left:3px solid var(--accent-gold);">
    <b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">🔧 THE HANDLE IS STUCK. HOW DO YOU OPEN IT?</b><br><br>

    <!-- FAILED BRUTE FORCE WARNING MESSAGE -->
    <<if $utility_bruteforce_fail>>
        <div style="padding:10px; background:rgba(138,28,28,0.3); border:1px solid var(--accent-red); color:#ff6b6b; margin-bottom:15px; text-align:center;">
            ❌ <b>BRUTE FORCE FAILED.</b> You kick the door with everything you have, but it only rattles loudly in the frame. Your leg throbs. The handle is still stuck.
        </div>
        <<unset $utility_bruteforce_fail>>
    <</if>>

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- BYPASS METHODS GRID (6 OPTIONS)            -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <div class="choice-menu" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;">

        <!-- 1. JOB CHECK -->
        <<if $job == "Mechanic" or $job == "Carpenter">>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "Disassemble the casing[JOB]">>
                    <<addTime 3>>
                    <<exert _halfCost>>
                    <<run setup.sound.play("tool_use", "audio/sfx/metal_tinkering.mp3", false, 0.8)>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[MECHANIC / CARPENTER]</b> Cost: <<print _halfCost>> STAMINA (Halved). You understand commercial hardware. You pop the pins and remove the handle safely.</span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <button disabled style="height: 100%; opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
                <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Disassemble the casing</span><br>
                <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">[REQUIRES MECHANIC OR CARPENTER] You lack the occupational knowledge to safely strip the hardware without breaking it.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <!-- 2. TRAIT CHECK -->
        <<if hasTrait("LOCKSMITH") or hasTrait("GHOST")>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🤫 Work it open without force [TRAIT]">>
                    <<addTime 1>>
                    <<exert _halfCost>>
                    <<run setup.sound.play("lockpick", "audio/sfx/lockpick_click.mp3", false, 0.8)>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[LOCKSMITH / GHOST]</b> Cost: <<print _halfCost>> STAMINA (Halved). Not locked — just stuck. A little finesse in the right spot and it releases smoothly.</span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <button disabled style="height: 100%; opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
                <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">🤫 Work it open without force</span><br>
                <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">[REQUIRES LOCKSMITH OR GHOST] You lack the specialized touch to finesse the jammed spindle without breaking it.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <!-- 3. SKILL CHECK -->
        <<if $skills.tech >= 1>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🔌 Release it manually [TECH 1]">>
                    <<addTime 3>>
                    <<exert _halfCost>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[TECH 1]</b> Cost: <<print _halfCost>> STAMINA (Halved). You examine the handle, find where the spindle has seized against its housing, and work it free. Clean.</span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <button disabled style="height: 100%; opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
                <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">🔌 Release it manually</span><br>
                <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">[REQUIRES TECH 1] You don't have the mechanical knowledge to figure out exactly where the internal spindle has seized.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <!-- 4. ATTRIBUTE CHECK (FIXED FROM 40 TO 4) -->
        <<if $str >= 4>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "💪 Muscle it open [STR 4]">>
                    <<addTime 1>>
                    <<exert _halfCost>>
                    <<run setup.sound.play("smash", "audio/sfx/metal_smash.mp3", false, 0.9)>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[STR 4]</b> Cost: <<print _halfCost>> STAMINA (Halved). You grab it two-handed, put your shoulder into it, and wrench. Something cracks inside the mechanism. The door opens.</span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <button disabled style="height: 100%; opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
                <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">💪 Muscle it open</span><br>
                <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">[REQUIRES STR 4] You aren't strong enough to force the rusted mechanism to turn.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <!-- 5. ITEM CHECK -->
        <<if $equip.weapon == "Crowbar" or $equip.weapon == "Tire Iron">>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🔧 Pry it open with <<print $equip.weapon>>">>
                    <<addTime 2>>
                    <<exert _halfCost>>
                    <<run setup.sound.play("pry_metal", "audio/sfx/metal_groan.mp3", false, 0.9)>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[PHYSICS]</b> Cost: <<print _halfCost>> STAMINA (Halved). You slot the bar between the door and frame near the latch and lever down. It pops with a deep thud.</span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <button disabled style="height: 100%; opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
                <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">🔧 Pry the handle assembly off</span><br>
                <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">[REQUIRES STURDY TOOL] You could pop the mechanism housing if you had a crowbar or heavy lever equipped.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <!-- 6. LAST RESORT (70% RNG CHANCE) -->
        <button style="grid-column: span 2; border-left-color: var(--accent-red) !important;">
            <<link "🦵 Kick it open — full force [BRUTE FORCE]">>
                <<addTime 2>>
                <<exert _baseCost>>
                <<run setup.sound.play("heavy_kick", "audio/sfx/heavy_kick.mp3", false, 1.0)>>
                /* 70/30 RNG SPLIT */
                <<if random(1, 100) <= 70>>
                    <<run window.shakeScreen(10)>>
                    <<set $utility_opened to true>>
                <<else>>
                    <<run window.shakeScreen(20)>>
                    <<set $utility_bruteforce_fail to true>>
                <</if>>
                <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-red);">[LAST RESORT: 70% SUCCESS CHANCE]</b> Cost: <<print _baseCost>> STAMINA. The door bangs hard against the wall inside. It might work. It might not. <br><i style="color:#ff9999;">(If you lack the Stamina, this will drain your HP).</i></span>
        </button>

    </div> 
    <!-- End of Bypass Methods Grid -->

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- LEAVE OPTION                               -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <button>
            <<link "🚪 Leave it — return to the hallway">>
                <<unset $utility_bruteforce_fail>> /* Cleanup flag if they leave */
                <<set $hallwaySection to 4>>
                <<goto "Hallway">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Back to the corridor. Section 4.</span>
        </button>
    </div>

</div>


<<else>>
/* ===================================================================== */
/* PHASE 2: INSIDE THE CLOSET (OPENED/LOOTING STATE)                     */
/* ===================================================================== */
<h2>UTILITY CLOSET — MAINTENANCE SUPPLIES</h2>

<div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
    <img src="image/hallway/utility_door_opened.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
</div>

The door swings inward.

Industrial chemicals hit you immediately — bleach, ammonia, floor cleaner. The sharp, synthetic smell of someone doing their job, right up until they weren't.

The rattling was a mop bucket, rocking slightly on its wheels every time the building shifts. In the quiet of the hallway, the sound carried further than it had any right to.

Shelves line both walls, organized by someone methodical and probably bored — cleaning supplies on the left, tools and hardware on the right. At the back, hanging from a dedicated hook: a heavy-duty industrial flashlight beside a coiled nylon rope and a mounted spare battery pack.

This is better than you expected.

<div style="margin-top:20px; padding:15px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-left:3px solid var(--accent-blue);">
    <b style="color:var(--accent-blue);">🔦 WHAT DO YOU TAKE?</b><br><br>

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- LOOTING GRID                               -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <div class="choice-menu" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;">

        <<if not $looted_utility_flashlight>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🔦 Take the flashlight">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_flashlight to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Flashlight", 1)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Heavy-duty. Battery is full.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $looted_utility_batteries>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🔋 Take the battery pack">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_batteries to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Batteries", 4)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Four AAs, still sealed in packaging.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $looted_utility_rope>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🪢 Take the nylon rope">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_rope to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Rope", 1)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Twelve meters, coiled and clipped.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $looted_utility_tape>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🖤 Take the duct tape">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_tape to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Duct Tape", 1)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">A full roll. Fixes everything temporarily.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $looted_utility_bleach>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🧴 Take the bleach">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_bleach to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Bleach", 1)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Good for sanitizing wounds or an improvised chemical deterrent.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $looted_utility_gloves>>
            <button style="height: 100%;">
                <<link "🧤 Take the work gloves">>
                    <<addTime 1>> /* Added Time Cost */
                    <<set $looted_utility_gloves to true>>
                    <<run setup.addItem("Work Gloves", 1)>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Heavy rubber. Protects your hands.</span>
            </button>
        <</if>>

        <<if not $read_utility_log>>
            <button style="grid-column: span 2;">
                <<link "📋 Read the maintenance log (2 mins)">>
                    <<set $read_utility_log to true>>
                    <<addTime 2>> /* Fixed from 1 to 2 to match narrative text */
                    /* ADD TO LORE DATABASE */
                    <<run window.addLore("Ascott Maintenance Log", "Saturday, 11:15 PM. Noise complaint on the 2nd floor. Found some guy in a suit standing in the mid-hallway, just smashing his head against the wall. Blood everywhere. Tried to ask if he needed help, but he just made this awful, wet rattling noise.")>>
                    <<goto "Utility_Closet">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Last entry: <i>"Saturday, 11:15 PM. Noise complaint on the 2nd floor..."</i></span>
            </button>
        <<else>>
            <div style="grid-column: span 2; padding:8px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border:1px solid #333; font-style:italic; color:#666; margin-bottom:8px;">
                You've read the log. Whatever is down on the 2nd floor has been there since last night. And it's not human anymore.
            </div>
        <</if>>

    </div> 
    <!-- End of Looting Grid -->

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- CLEARED ROOM MESSAGE                       -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <<if $looted_utility_flashlight and $looted_utility_batteries and $looted_utility_rope and $looted_utility_tape and $looted_utility_bleach and $looted_utility_gloves>>
        <div style="padding:10px; background:rgba(0,100,0,0.2); border:1px solid var(--accent-green); font-style:italic; color:#99cc99;">
            You've stripped the shelves of everything useful. The mop bucket rattles softly in the dark behind you as you go.
        </div>
    <</if>>

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- LEAVE OPTION                               -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <button>
            <<link "🚪 Leave and return to the hallway">>
                <<set $hallwaySection to 4>>
                <<goto "Hallway">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Back to the corridor. Section 4.</span>
        </button>
    </div>

</div>
<</if>>